gT3(){return"Full redesign of the news app on Android with Compose and iOS with SwiftUI, contributing to planning, design and ideation \u2014 especially around Ads \u2014 plus hands-on native development."},
gT5(){return"Ads SDK architecture for Magalu, Netshoes and Zattini across Android and iOS."},
gT4(){return"Native BLE integration for Glooko glucose monitoring inside a React Native healthcare app."},
