gT2(){return"White-label telematics SDK with sensors, GPS, BLE and driver-behavior algorithms."},
gT6(){return"OCR/liveness framework that reduced manual document rejection by ~96% for financial clients."},
gT7(){return"\u2022 Built Android applications for hospitality, booking, financial-market data and sales-force automation, including smartphone/tablet support, adaptive interfaces and offline-first synchronization.\n\u2022 Contributed to a reusable white-label Android codebase that enabled approximately 40 hotel apps with centralized evolution, brand-specific customization and lower maintenance cost.\n\u2022 Implemented real-time financial ticker UI updates, backend integrations, local storage, Windows Azure synchronization and early Android production support responsibilities."},
